Slide 1: Title
Title: 面向包装/注塑的PE原料私域B2B供应链平台
Subtitle: 内容驱动 + 私域复购 + 小额供应链金融
Footer: Prepared for: 投资人 / Date

Slide 2: Core Conclusion
- 面向包装薄膜与注塑制造的PE原料线上撮合平台，凭借内容+私域+SEM 的获客组合，三年内中性情景可实现 Year3 GMV ≈ 7 亿元，单位经济健康（LTV/CAC ≈ 5.8）。

Speaker notes: 用一句话描述市场机会与商业模型，吸引投资人继续看下一页。

Slide 3: Market Snapshot (TAM / SAM / SOM)
- TAM（中国PE材料市场）≈ 3,500 亿元
- SAM（线上可服务）≈ 700 亿元（薄膜 420 亿 / 注塑 280 亿）
- Year3 SOM（中性）= 1% SAM = 7 亿元；乐观 3% = 21 亿元

Speaker notes: 给出计算公式与主要假设（总量、平均价格、线上化渗透率）。

Slide 4: Acquisition & Channels (Online-first)
- Channel mix: Content/SEO 30%, Private domain/social 20%, SEM 25%, Short video/live 20%, Programmatic 5%
- Weighted online CAC ≈ ¥13k per buyer (range ¥10k–18k)
- Funnel: Impression->CTR 1.0% -> Click->Inquiry 8% -> Inquiry->Register 60% -> Register->First order 12%

Speaker notes: Emphasize content pool + private domain value and short-video/SEM for fast scaling.

Slide 5: Unit Economics
- Avg buyer annual GMV = ¥2.4M (20t/order × 12 orders × ¥10k/ton)
- Annual revenue per buyer = ¥36,000 (take rate 1.5%)
- Annual gross profit per buyer = ¥25,200 (70% gross margin)
- CAC = ¥13,000 -> CAC payback ≈ 6.2 months
- LTV (3 years) = ¥75,600 -> LTV/CAC ≈ 5.8

Speaker notes: Show core unit economics and highlight high ARPU & repeatability.

Slide 6: Revenue Mix & 3-year Highlights
- Assumptions (base): GMV Y1=¥70M; Y2=¥300M; Y3=¥700M
- Revenue = GMV × 1.5%; Gross margin = Revenue × 70%
- Opex (online-first): Y1=¥4.5M; Y2=¥8.5M; Y3=¥11M
- Note: Y3 approaching breakeven; profit depends on take rate & finance revenue

Speaker notes: Summarize cost items (marketing, product, risk control, ops) and fund pool implications.

Slide 7: Product & Risk Control
- Product: Inquiry matching, contract templates, ERP/API integrations, supplier QC & returns flow
- Risk control: Supplier/buyer KYC, credit scoring, deposits & credit limits, co-operation with banks/factors for financing

Speaker notes: Emphasize risk control as core for finance and credit offerings.

Slide 8: 30/60/90 Execution Plan (KPIs)
- 0–30d: MVP (matchmaking page), 1 whitepaper + 5 articles, short video scripts; budget ¥300k–500k; KPI: monthly GMV ¥5M
- 30–60d: Scale content, weekly live streams, private domain ops, connect 1 financial partner for pilot; KPI: monthly GMV ¥15M–30M
- 60–90d: Optimize channels, complete industry case study, prepare scale-up; KPI: monthly GMV ¥30M–70M; 3-month retention ≥60%

Speaker notes: Quantified KPIs for testing assumptions.

Slide 9: Fundraising & Use of Funds
- Round ask: ¥100M–150M
  - Go-to-market & ops (18–24 months): ¥30M–50M
  - Initial finance pool Y1: ¥20M -> Y3 target ¥70M (option: co-build with bank)
  - Contingency/compliance/team: ¥10M–30M

Speaker notes: Phased fund use; stress finance pool necessity to boost conversions.

Slide 10: Risks & Mitigation
- Credit risk: deposits + bank/factor co-financing + limit controls
- Low-quality traffic: private-domain cultivation + qualification gating
- Price volatility: short-term fixed contracts + hedging/inventory buffers
- Compliance: templates & legal support

Speaker notes: Brief mitigations for each risk.

Slide 11: Appendix (Data tables)
- TAM inputs: PE volume 35M tons; avg price ¥10k/ton -> TAM ¥350B
- SAM inputs: 20% onlineable -> SAM ¥70B (film ¥42B / injection ¥28B)
- Channel CACs & funnel metrics
- Unit economics calc sheet

Speaker notes: Appendix for deeper due diligence.


